---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Consulting & Speaking | Regina, Saskatchewan & Online | Span AI Solutions"
  description="One-on-one and group AI consulting, online or in person in Regina and Saskatchewan. Book Josh Muller, an AI expert featured in El Espectador, to speak at your event."
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero page-shell" aria-labelledby="consulting-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">AI Consulting</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title" id="consulting-title">Talk to an AI expert who speaks your language.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Clear, practical guidance on using AI in your business or your life, with no jargon, no hype, and real next steps.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/contact?service=consulting">Request a session</a>
        <a class="button button--ghost" href="#sessions">See session options</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-label="Credentials and testimonial">
      <p><a href="https://www.elespectador.com/economia/empresas/el-reto-que-hereda-john-ternus-ceo-de-apple-adaptarse-a-los-avances-de-la-inteligencia-artificial/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">As featured in El Espectador</a></p>
      <ul class="cards">
        <li class="card">18 years of experience in technology.</li>
        <li class="card">Consulted for several of the world's top five expert networks.</li>
        <li class="card">Interviewed by El Espectador, one of Colombia's largest newspapers, as an AI and technology expert.</li>
      </ul>
      <blockquote class="quote">
        <p>“We saw results on our first day of implementing Josh's business advice. He is top-notch; sharp, personable, kind, and professional. Very highly recommended!”</p>
        <footer>— Josh Parkman, award-winning music producer</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-label="Josh in the press">
      <blockquote class="quote">
        <p>“Winning in the AI era doesn't have to mean building a great app. It can mean winning the way Nvidia has — by building the technology AI runs on.”</p>
        <footer>— Josh Muller, in El Espectador</footer>
      </blockquote>
      <p class="section-copy">His advice to leaders: spending more on AI doesn't guarantee better results. The real question is whether it makes your organization better, helps your people, and creates value for your customers.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="consulting-audience">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="consulting-audience">Whether you're running a business or just getting started</h2>
      <ul class="cards">
        <li class="card">Business owners who want to know where AI fits, and where it doesn't.</li>
        <li class="card">Teams who need to get up to speed on AI together.</li>
        <li class="card">Curious individuals who want a trusted guide to understand AI and use it well.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" id="sessions" aria-labelledby="consulting-sessions">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="consulting-sessions">Session options</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card"><h3>One-on-one session</h3><p>A focused one-hour session with Josh, online from anywhere in the world or in person in Regina and across Saskatchewan. Bring your questions and leave with clear next steps.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact?service=consulting">Request a session</a></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Group sessions</h3><p>Practical AI sessions for teams, organizations and groups, delivered online or in person in Saskatchewan.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact?service=consulting">Request a group session</a></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Speaking engagements</h3><p>Book Josh to speak on AI and technology at your conference or event, anywhere in the world. Please book well in advance. Speaking fee plus travel expenses apply.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact?service=consulting">Book Josh to speak</a></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="consulting-expect">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="consulting-expect">What to expect</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card"><h3>Before</h3><p>tell us what you want to get out of the session.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>During</h3><p>a practical, honest conversation focused on your situation.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>After</h3><p>you leave with clear next steps you can act on.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="consulting-josh">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="consulting-josh">Meet your consultant</h2>
      <img class="portrait-photo consultant-portrait" src="/images/josh-muller.webp" width="640" height="480" alt="Josh Muller" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <h3>Josh Muller</h3>
      <p>Co-founder, AI Solutions, Product &amp; Strategy</p>
      <p class="section-copy">Josh has spent 18 years in technology, building systems that help small teams do big things. As Localization Director at Waha, he helps coordinate work across 180+ countries and 60+ languages.</p>
      <a href="/about">Read our story →</a>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="consulting-pricing">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="consulting-pricing">Pricing</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">Pricing depends on the session type and group size. Request a session and we'll send you the details.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell faq" aria-labelledby="consulting-faq">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="consulting-faq">FAQ</h2>
      <details><summary>Do I need to know anything about AI already?</summary><p>Not at all. Sessions are built around where you are today.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can you help with my specific business?</summary><p>Yes. Every session is focused on your goals and your situation.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I want help building something afterwards?</summary><p>We can scope it for you through our <a href="/custom-ai-solutions">Custom AI Solutions</a> service, starting with a free systems audit.</p></details>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="consulting-cta">
      <div class="cta-panel">
        <h2 class="section-heading" id="consulting-cta">Get clear on AI in one hour.</h2>
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/contact?service=consulting">Request a session</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
